################################################################################
project:
  name: unit_converter_Cpp
  language: cpp
  standard: c++17
  build: cmake
  test_framework: catch2
  description: >
    길이 단위 변환 CLI. meter 기준 환산, 동적 단위 등록,
    설정 외부화(JSON), 출력 포맷(table/json/csv). BCE + TDD.

################################################################################
code_style:
  formatter: clang-format
  formatter_style: LLVM
  indent: 4
  column_limit: 100
  naming:
    type_class: PascalCase
    function_method: camelCase
    variable: camelCase
    constant: kPascalCase
    namespace: lower_snake
    file: PascalCase
  header_source_split:
    principle: declaration in .hpp, definition in .cpp
    exceptions:
      - templates and constexpr requiring ODR-use in headers
      - small value types (<= 3 methods) may stay header-only with ADR comment
  include_order:
    - corresponding_header
    - c_stdlib
    - cpp_stdlib
    - third_party
    - project
  rules:
    - "Prefer const, explicit constructors, override/final"
    - "No using namespace std in headers"
    - "Use std::optional or Result type for domain failures; avoid bool+out-param"
    - "Smart pointers only at boundaries; domain value objects by value"

################################################################################
architecture:
  pattern: boundary_control_entity
  layers:
    entity:
      alias: domain
      responsibility: >
        UnitCatalog, LengthAmount, ConversionEngine, invariants, pure conversion.
        No I/O, no format strings, no filesystem.
      path: src/entity/
    control:
      responsibility: >
        Use-case orchestration only. Calls entity + ports; no parsing, no formatting.
      path: src/control/
    boundary:
      responsibility: >
        CLI entry, InputParser, OutputFormatter(Table/Json/Csv), ErrorPresenter.
      path: src/boundary/
    data:
      responsibility: >
        IUnitDefinitionRepository implementations (InMemory, File JSON).
      path: src/data/
  dependency_direction:
    allowed:
      - boundary -> control
      - control -> entity
      - control -> data_ports
      - data -> entity_types_only
    forbidden:
      - entity -> boundary
      - entity -> data
      - entity -> control
      - data -> boundary
  ports:
    - IUnitDefinitionRepository
  invariants_ref:
    - INV-D01
    - INV-D02
    - INV-D03
    - INV-D04
    - INV-D05
    - INV-D06
    - INV-D07
    - INV-D08

################################################################################
tdd_rules:
  red_phase:
    description: >
      Catch2 테스트를 먼저 작성하고, Domain→Data→Boundary→Integration 순으로
      실패(RED)를 확인한 뒤 최소 구현으로 넘어간다.
    rules:
      - "테스트 제목·시나리오는 BCE Traceability Matrix(DT/BT/DAT/IT)와 1:1 대응"
      - "Domain TC를 최우선 RED: LengthAmount, UnitCatalog, LengthConversionEngine"
      - "Invariant(INV-D01~D08)마다 최소 1개 실패 TC 존재 확인 후 구현 시작"
      - "파싱·음수·미지원 단위·비율·동적 등록·출력(JSON/CSV/표) 분류별 RED 유지"
      - "ε·반올림(1자리)·에러 문구 패턴은 테스트에 상수로 고정"
      - "RED 단계에서 프로덕션 구현 파일 추가·기존 if-else 확장 금지"
      - "Catch2 실행 결과: 신규 TC 전부 실패가 정상(GREEN 전제 없음)"
    must_not:
      - "테스트 없이 Domain/Business 로직 작성"
      - "통합·E2E만 작성하고 Domain RED 생략"
      - "가짜 통과(hard-coded return, mock이 전부 성공만 반환)"
      - "README 요구를 테스트 ID 없이 구현"
      - "여러 Invariant를 한 거대 TC에 묶어 실패 원인 불명확하게 만들기"

  green_phase:
    description: >
      RED TC를 하나씩 GREEN으로 바꾸며, Domain 순수 로직→Data(Port)→Boundary 순으로
      최소 코드만 추가한다. Control은 얇게 유지한다.
    rules:
      - "한 번에 1 TC(또는 동일 Invariant 묶음)만 GREEN; 전부 한꺼번에 X"
      - "Domain: meter 기준 환산식만 구현; stdin/파일/JSON 문자열 Domain 유입 금지"
      - "GREEN 후 즉시 Catch2 전체 재실행; 기존 TC 회귀 0"
      - "비율 상수는 UnitDefinition/설정 단일 출처; main/Parser에 중복 상수 금지"
      - "Boundary GREEN 시 Domain Mock 또는 실제 Domain 주입 명시"
      - "Data GREEN: InMemory Repository 먼저, File(JSON)은 DAT-TC 통과 후"
      - "에러 코드→고정 message 패턴 매핑은 ErrorPresenter 한 곳"
    must_not:
      - "GREEN을 위해 Invariant·ε·반올림 규칙 변경"
      - "테스트 삭제·skip·DISABLE로 통과 처리"
      - "if-else 단위 분기 누적로 OCP/SRP 우회"
      - "Boundary에 환산 수식·factorToMeter 비즈니스 로직"
      - "설정/동적 등록/출력 포맷을 RED 없이 일괄 구현"

  refactor_phase:
    description: >
      해당 범위 TC가 전부 GREEN인 상태에서만 구조 개선한다.
      리팩터 후 Catch2·커버리지 게이트로 행동 불변을 증명한다.
    rules:
      - "리팩터 전후 TC 목록·assertion·exit code 동일(MESSAGE-LOCK/ROUND-LOCK)"
      - "SRP: Parser/Formatter/Repository/Engine/Catalog 분리; Control은 오케스트만"
      - "OCP: 신규 단위·출력 포맷은 기존 Domain 수정 없이 확장 가능한지 TC로 확인"
      - "중복 제거 후 Domain 라인 커버리지 ≥95%, Boundary ≥85%, Data ≥90%"
      - "의존 방향: Boundary→Control→Domain←Data; Domain이 Boundary/Data include 금지"
      - "리팩터 단위는 1 컴포넌트·1 책임; TC GREEN 유지하며 커밋 단위 축소"
    must_not:
      - "RED·GREEN 중 refactor (테스트 실패 상태에서 구조만 변경)"
      - "공개 Domain API 시그니처 변경 without TC·계약 동시 갱신"
      - "리팩터 중 신규 요구(기능) 추가"
      - "테스트를 리팩터에 맞게 느슨하게 변경해 통과"
      - "통합 테스트 제거로 Domain 커버리지만 충족"

################################################################################
testing:
  framework: catch2
  version_min: "3.0"
  pattern: AAA
  aaa_structure:
    arrange: "Given catalog, input, format, config fixture"
    act: "Invoke parser, use case, or formatter under test"
    assert: "REQUIRE/CHECK numeric epsilon, exact strings, exit codes"
  directories:
    unit: tests/unit/
    integration: tests/integration/
  fixtures:
    - name: DefaultUnitCatalogFixture
      scope: "3 units meter/feet/yard with INV-D08 factors"
    - name: EmptyCatalogFixture
      scope: INV-D05 edge
    - name: TempConfigFileFixture
      scope: data layer JSON load
    - name: CaptureStdoutStderrFixture
      scope: boundary output and error JSON
  rules:
    - "One logical assertion theme per TEST_CASE; use SECTION for variants"
    - "TEST_CASE name: Layer_Scenario_ExpectedOutcome"
    - "Domain tests: no filesystem, no stdin; inject catalog by value"
    - "Boundary tests: mock IUnitDefinitionRepository or stub catalog"
    - "Integration tests: minimal IT-01~08 from traceability matrix"
    - "Floating compare: REQUIRE_THAT with Catch::Matchers::WithinAbs(epsilon)"
  coverage:
    tool: gcov/lcov or llvm-cov
    line_targets:
      entity: 95
      boundary: 85
      data: 90
      control: 80
      overall: 88
    gate: "Do not merge if any layer below target after GREEN scope"

################################################################################
forbidden:
  - id: F01
    pattern: "std::cout / std::cerr for debug tracing in entity/ or control/"
    reason: "Pollutes Boundary contract tests and hides structured ErrorPresenter"
    alternative: "Return DomainError; Boundary formats message; tests use CaptureStdoutStderrFixture"
  - id: F02
    pattern: "Literal conversion factors (3.28084, 1.09361) outside config/UnitDefinition"
    reason: "Violates INV-D08 single source and OCP for new units"
    alternative: "Load from units.json via IUnitDefinitionRepository; test with fixture file"
  - id: F03
    pattern: "catch (...) { } or catch (...) without rethrow/log mapping"
    reason: "Swallows parse and domain failures; breaks ERR-* contract tests"
    alternative: "Catch std::exception& at boundary only; map to ERR-PARSE-* / ERR-DOMAIN-*"
  - id: F04
    pattern: "Non-template function definitions in .hpp included by multiple TUs"
    reason: "ODR violations and hidden dependencies in headers"
    alternative: "Declare in .hpp, define in .cpp; templates stay in *_impl.hpp if needed"
  - id: F05
    pattern: "Global mutable catalog, format flags, or unit tables"
    reason: "Race-prone, untestable order, breaks injectable Control"
    alternative: "Pass UnitCatalog by const ref through use cases; main wires dependencies once"
  - id: F06
    pattern: "if (unit == \"feet\") chains for conversion in main or parser"
    reason: "Breaks OCP; each new unit edits multiple sites"
    alternative: "UnitCatalog + LengthConversionEngine loop over registered definitions"
  - id: F07
    pattern: "#include boundary/ or data/ headers from entity/"
    reason: "Reverses dependency direction; couples domain to I/O"
    alternative: "Entity includes only standard library and entity headers"

################################################################################
file_structure:
  tree: |
    project_root/
    ├── .cursorrules
    ├── CMakeLists.txt
    ├── config/
    │   └── units.json              # default factors (INV-D08)
    ├── src/
    │   ├── main.cpp                # wire boundary + control + repos
    │   ├── entity/                 # domain: catalog, engine, value types
    │   ├── control/                # use cases: convert, register
    │   ├── boundary/               # parser, formatters, error presenter, entry
    │   └── data/                   # file + in-memory repositories
    └── tests/
        ├── unit/
        │   ├── entity/
        │   ├── control/
        │   ├── boundary/
        │   └── data/
        └── integration/
  rules:
    - "One public class or cohesive module pair (.hpp/.cpp) per file"
    - "Tests mirror src layer paths under tests/unit/"
    - "No production code under tests/ except helpers/fakes"

################################################################################
ai_behavior:
  principles:
    - "Tests before production code (RED → GREEN → REFACTOR)"
    - "Never violate layer dependency_direction"
    - "Refactor only when all affected Catch2 tests are GREEN"
  must:
    - "Read architecture.dependency_direction before adding includes"
    - "Add or extend Catch2 TEST_CASE before implementing new behavior"
    - "Place conversion math only in entity/; parsing only in boundary/"
    - "Run full Catch2 suite after each GREEN increment"
    - "Map errors through ErrorPresenter; use forbidden list as checklist"
  must_not:
    - "Implement features while prior RED tests still failing"
    - "Refactor during RED or partial-GREEN phases"
    - "Add entity → boundary/data includes to satisfy convenience"
    - "Skip tests, weaken assertions, or disable cases to pass CI"
    - "Introduce forbidden patterns (F01~F07) even as temporary debug"
  when_uncertain:
    - "Default to entity unit test RED with smallest public API change"
